  id: Q2
  textDA: "Hvorfor kan meget varmt vejr v\xE6re d\xE5rligt for pandaer? "
  textEN: Why can it be difficult for pandas to live toghether for longer periods
    of time?
  multiSelect: 0
  showLetters: 1
  horizontalLayout: 0
  logAsNumber: 0
  options:
  - textDA: "Bambus holder op med at vokse, n\xE5r vejret bliver varmt."
    textEN: Bamboo stops growing when the weather gets warm.
    correct: 0
    exclusive: 0
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - textDA: "De er n\xF8dt til at sove hele sommeren.  "
    textEN: They need to sleep through the whole summer.
    correct: 0
    exclusive: 0
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - textDA: "De kan f\xE5 det for varmt og blive syge."
    textEN: They can get too hot and become sick.
    correct: 1
    exclusive: 0
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - textDA: 'De kan ikke finde nok skygge i bjergene. '
    textEN: They cannot find enough shade in the mountains.
    correct: 0
    exclusive: 0
    icon: {fileID: 0}
